    Most laptop scrap price quotes online are variations on 'per kg' rates that don't reflect how buyback actually works. This blog explains the five variables that actually move the number, why an old plastic laptop weighs almost as much as a new MacBook but has 100x less value, and how to get an accurate estimate before committing to pickup.
  </p>

